    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>probably fragments of cloth, because exported together with lists (OED s.v. shard, sherd n.1 4c, 4d) | fragments of cloth (OED s.v. shard, sherd n.1 4c, 4d) | (of cloth) | remnants and lists, the selvage, border, or edge of a cloth, usually of different material from the body of the cloth (OED s.v. list n.2 1a) | of cloth | shreds, remnants of cloth</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
    <crm:P2_has_type rdf:resource="http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E33_Linguistic_Object"/>
